                                                "sense_id": "e54d947e-93c2-3459-acb4-45905f5c0663",
                                                "text": "I had bought some jeans and a couple of blue chambray workshirts to replace the kitchen-whites, but such clothes weren't nearly enough."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0369a19f-3859-4202-89d0-c06cbdd56125",
                                                "sense_id": "e54d947e-93c2-3459-acb4-45905f5c0663",
                                                "text": "Always, the relentless bass of hip-hop blasting in rooms of nautical-themed furnishings, faded driftwood, gingham upholstery, linen and chambray."
